## Operator-action ticket format

When the operator responds to an operator-action ticket, the format is:

```
Approve: "Approved. Proceed."
Reject: "Rejected. [Reason]"
Modify: "Modified: [what changed]"
Defer: "Deferred. [When to revisit]"
```

